  m_Name: Broker Barnaby
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Broker Barnaby
  offerText: Accidents happen, sir. Pay my premium now, and should any... unfortunate
    physical ailments occur today, my firm will compensate you generously.
  acceptResultText: You sign the heavy paperwork and hand over the cash. You feel
    remarkably secure.
  rejectResultText: You confidently tear up his contract, feeling healthy, bold,
    and happy to keep your money.
  acceptedDelayedText: You slip on a wet floor and twist your ankle terribly. Thankfully,
    Barnaby's insurance check arrives instantly to cover the pain.
  rejectedDelayedText: You slip on a wet floor. With no insurance, you must pay the
    exorbitant medical bills entirely out of your own pocket.
